[{:db/id 17592186161930 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-377d9ecb-b1f2-5b7d-b293-34044d6f6558" "question-4b3ef3ac-d2db-5eb8-8c5f-a033b26be69b"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186161931 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-04d4be2b-e767-5839-99c5-470d8cac4dc9" "question-be9c7f67-1bb2-5f32-8555-0a5418fba86d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186161932 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-9bd8d602-6713-5d8a-8e29-384c77e10125" "question-d71bf438-c740-5ac5-956a-edf3ba9d43d6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186161933 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-15d3a8f7-57e9-5955-b347-e7b15292f88f" "question-a86905dc-6d69-50e5-afb3-4d8bb353dbfd"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-377d9ecb-b1f2-5b7d-b293-34044d6f6558" :question/id #uuid "377d9ecb-b1f2-5b7d-b293-34044d6f6558" :question/math-academy-id "q-132173" :question/problem "Given that the random variable $X∼\\text{Exp}(\\frac{1}{5}),$ calculate $P(X\\le 2).$ Round your final answer to four decimal places." :question/worked-solution "An exponential random variable $X$ with rate $\\lambda $ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\lambda {e}^{-\\lambda x}, & x\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're given that\n\n$$\nX∼\\text{Exp}(\\frac{1}{5}).\n$$\n\nSo, $X$ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{5}{e}^{-x/5}, & x\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can calculate $P(X\\le 2)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X\\le 2) & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{5}{e}^{-x/5}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{{e}^{-x/5}|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =-{e}^{-2/5}+{e}^{0} \\\\  & ≈0.3297\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2f87a4b8-066c-5da9-b676-ea815d24ff9f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2f87a4b8-066c-5da9-b676-ea815d24ff9f" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f87a4b8-066c-5da9-b676-ea815d24ff9f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-aeb85eac-0073-5d12-9fad-bb5b6c84c2f3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b07b0fbc-b758-5397-9f9a-f0c56f381e23" "answer-a2cad5b5-d85b-5775-9ae3-23738e9a9e95" "answer-aeb85eac-0073-5d12-9fad-bb5b6c84c2f3" "answer-adb828a8-83fa-5e72-8b2f-372fd52cbd31" "answer-15122c8a-6495-57b5-bc9a-8504dc7b9d5f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b07b0fbc-b758-5397-9f9a-f0c56f381e23" :answer/id #uuid "b07b0fbc-b758-5397-9f9a-f0c56f381e23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3137" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a2cad5b5-d85b-5775-9ae3-23738e9a9e95" :answer/id #uuid "a2cad5b5-d85b-5775-9ae3-23738e9a9e95" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3279" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aeb85eac-0073-5d12-9fad-bb5b6c84c2f3" :answer/id #uuid "aeb85eac-0073-5d12-9fad-bb5b6c84c2f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3297" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-adb828a8-83fa-5e72-8b2f-372fd52cbd31" :answer/id #uuid "adb828a8-83fa-5e72-8b2f-372fd52cbd31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3337" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-15122c8a-6495-57b5-bc9a-8504dc7b9d5f" :answer/id #uuid "15122c8a-6495-57b5-bc9a-8504dc7b9d5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3927" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4b3ef3ac-d2db-5eb8-8c5f-a033b26be69b" :question/id #uuid "4b3ef3ac-d2db-5eb8-8c5f-a033b26be69b" :question/math-academy-id "q-132179" :question/problem "Given that the random variable $X∼\\text{Exp}(\\sqrt{3}),$ calculate $P(X<\\frac{1}{3}).$ Round your final answer to four decimal places." :question/worked-solution "An exponential random variable $X$ with rate $\\lambda $ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\lambda {e}^{-\\lambda x}, & x\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're given that\n\n$$\nX∼\\text{Exp}(\\sqrt{3}).\n$$\n\nSo, $X$ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}{e}^{-\\sqrt{3}x}, & x\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can calculate $P(X<\\frac{1}{3})$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X<\\frac{1}{3}) & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/3}\\sqrt{3}{e}^{-\\sqrt{3}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{e}^{-\\sqrt{3}x}{|}_{0}^{1/3} \\\\  & =-{e}^{-\\sqrt{3}/3}+{e}^{0} \\\\  & ≈0.4386\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0bc8a138-558e-5ca1-bd83-4c4ce4806474"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0bc8a138-558e-5ca1-bd83-4c4ce4806474" :answer-field/id #uuid "0bc8a138-558e-5ca1-bd83-4c4ce4806474" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-47bc7314-1895-551e-8d2a-b165d99e961e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-47bc7314-1895-551e-8d2a-b165d99e961e" "answer-2fc40c2d-1af0-5adc-a2bc-6557e8adc194" "answer-3e6f8763-9d72-5754-bbed-ce927bc4b0f3" "answer-31011ded-b236-51be-8752-9a8a39f1aa2a" "answer-3a08e9d4-be37-5bcd-b93a-f75705061f0d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47bc7314-1895-551e-8d2a-b165d99e961e" :answer/id #uuid "47bc7314-1895-551e-8d2a-b165d99e961e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.4386" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2fc40c2d-1af0-5adc-a2bc-6557e8adc194" :answer/id #uuid "2fc40c2d-1af0-5adc-a2bc-6557e8adc194" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.4683" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3e6f8763-9d72-5754-bbed-ce927bc4b0f3" :answer/id #uuid "3e6f8763-9d72-5754-bbed-ce927bc4b0f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.4768" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31011ded-b236-51be-8752-9a8a39f1aa2a" :answer/id #uuid "31011ded-b236-51be-8752-9a8a39f1aa2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.4836" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3a08e9d4-be37-5bcd-b93a-f75705061f0d" :answer/id #uuid "3a08e9d4-be37-5bcd-b93a-f75705061f0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.4886" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-04d4be2b-e767-5839-99c5-470d8cac4dc9" :question/id #uuid "04d4be2b-e767-5839-99c5-470d8cac4dc9" :question/math-academy-id "q-132193" :question/problem "Given that the random variable $X∼\\text{Exp}(\\sqrt{2}),$ calculate $P(X>\\sqrt{2}).$ Round your final answer to four decimal places." :question/worked-solution "An exponential random variable $X$ with rate $\\lambda $ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\lambda {e}^{-\\lambda x}, & x\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're given that\n\n$$\nX∼\\text{Exp}(\\sqrt{2}).\n$$\n\nSo, $X$ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2}{e}^{-\\sqrt{2}x}, & x\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can calculate $P(X>\\sqrt{2})$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X>\\sqrt{2}) & ={\\int }_{\\sqrt{2}}^{\\infty }f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\sqrt{2}}^{\\infty }\\sqrt{2}{e}^{-\\sqrt{2}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{e}^{-\\sqrt{2}x}{|}_{\\sqrt{2}}^{\\infty } \\\\  & ={e}^{-2} \\\\  & ≈0.1353\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-30cd8153-4b27-59dd-bd60-d805ce68023b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-30cd8153-4b27-59dd-bd60-d805ce68023b" :answer-field/id #uuid "30cd8153-4b27-59dd-bd60-d805ce68023b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-25462498-9604-5abf-a03e-8496f16cbe50" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b69c52c0-8e2e-5c56-a7ce-24a1cf21399a" "answer-ec1596e7-46b5-53ff-8622-206707f0ad5b" "answer-25462498-9604-5abf-a0